              "text": "trānstrum, trānstrī — \"a rowing bench, a thwart; a crossbeam\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Rēmigēs in trānstrīs sedent. The rowers sit on the benches."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Second declension, neuter: trānstrum, trānstrī n. The bench runs across the ship. English transom is usually traced to it."
            }
          ]
